#: .\engine_text.py:21 .\templates\planner\_tracks.html:8
msgid ""
"Every cat you're searching for - the targets you picked, your wishlist (when that search is on), and any future ubers you've toggled - with its next spot in these rolls. Click a position to jump to its cell."
msgstr ""
"你正在找的所有角色 - 你選的目標、願望清單(搜尋開啟時)以及開啟的未實裝超激 - 以及它在這段序列中下一次出現的位置。點擊位置即可跳到該格。"

#: .\engine_text.py:26 .\templates\planner\_track_cell.html:6
msgid ""
"Following the track dupes here: the previous pull obtains this same cat, so this cell rerolls into the branch value and jumps tracks"
msgstr "沿著這條線抽到這裡會稀有重複:前一抽拿到同一隻角色,所以這格會重抽成分支結果並換線"

