#: .\templates\planner\_tracks.html:69 .\templates\planner\_tracks.html:71
#: .\templates\planner\planner.html:142
msgid "Guaranteed"
msgstr "確定"

#: .\engine_text.py:33 .\templates\planner\_track_cell.html:6
msgid ""
"If this guaranteed multi's first roll comes up as a dupe, it rerolls and the multi ends on a different cell - you get this uber instead"
msgstr "這次確定連抽的第一抽若是稀有重複會重抽,連抽會在另一格結束 - 改為獲得這隻超激稀有"

