#: .\engine_text.py:45 .\templates\planner\_tracks.html:61
msgid ""
"Pad this banner's uber pool with expected-but-unreleased ubers (godfat's Count of future ubers) - its uber cells land as if those units were already in the pool; drag the box up/down to adjust"
