#: .\templates\planner\tiers.html:9
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The cumulative Uber &amp; Legend Rare ranking from <a href=\"%(source)s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">The Battle Cats Tier List</a>, matched to the catalogue (fetched %(fetched)s)."
msgstr ""
"來自<a href=\"%(source)s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">The Battle Cats Tier List</a>的超激與傳說稀有綜合排名,已對應到本站的角色資料(取得於%(fetched)s)。"

#: .\templates\planner\tiers.html:12
msgid ""
"Collab and limited units are left out; it ranks the standard permanent pool."
msgstr "不包含合作與限定角色,只排名一般常駐角色。"

#: .\templates\planner\tiers.html:13
msgid ""
"<strong>UF</strong> ranks a unit's Ultra Form, <strong>UT</strong> its Ultra Talents; a dimmed cat ranks higher up through one of those. Click a cat for its forms and wiki page."
msgstr ""
"<strong>UF</strong>是第4進化的排名,<strong>UT</strong>是超本能的排名;顯示較淡的角色會因其中之一而排得更高。點擊角色可查看型態與Wiki頁面。"

#: .\templates\planner\tiers.html:19
